      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present Apartment 60, The Holly, Rockfield, Dundrum, Dublin 16 to the market an exceptional two-bedroom, two-bathroom third floor apartment presented in impeccable turnkey condition throughout. Situated within the prestigious gated Rockfield development, No. 60 enjoys an unrivalled location in the heart of Dundrum. With Dundrum Town Centre quite literally across the road, residents have an outstanding selection of shops, award-winning cafés, restaurants, bars and leisure facilities at their fingertips. The LUAS at Balally is positioned directly outside the development, offering a quick and convenient commute to Dublin City Centre, while the M50 is just moments away. The nearby Airfield Estate provides a wonderful recreational amenity with its beautiful parkland, gardens and working farm, while Sandyford Business District and Beacon Hospital are both within easy reach. The development further benefits from beautifully maintained communal grounds and secure resident parking, completing this superb lifestyle offering.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation spans to c.73 sqm, and comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, generous open plan lounge and dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned double bedrooms including a master ensuite, and a main family bathroom. Located on the third floor, the apartment enjoys an abundance of natural light together with a practical and well-balanced layout designed for modern living.\nNo. 60 is presented in truly immaculate condition throughout, having been meticulously maintained by its current owners and offering the successful purchaser a genuine walk-in opportunity. Combining stylish interiors with spacious accommodation and an unbeatable location, this exceptional apartment is sure to impress from the moment you step inside.\nRarely does a property of this calibre become available in such a prime Dundrum location. Whether you're a first-time buyer, someone looking to trade down or an investor seeking a premium property in a highly sought-after development, No. 60 is sure to tick every box. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 73 sqm\n• BER B\n• 2 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Third floor apartment\n• Parking\n• Management fees c. 2,570 p/a\n• Gas heating\n• Sunny balcony\n• Turn key condition\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Luas directly outside the development\n• Plenty of bus routes on your doorstep\n• Dundrum Town Centre in arms reach\n• Airfield Estate and Gardens a stones throw\n• Ballawley Park a short stroll away\n• Sandyford Business District nearby\n• Beacon Hospital a 5-minute drive\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors\n• Viewing highly advised!\nDirections;\nEircode: D16P521"
      },
      {
